Potion Vapor Effects:
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
When a potion is broken near you (if you kick and break one, for instance, or
if a monster throws one at you), the vapor or splash from certain types of
potions can affect you.  The vapor effects of the various potions are
described as follows:

Potion name
  (Cur)  This will describe the effects that vapor from a broken potion will
         have on you if the potion was cursed.  If this section is missing,
         the effects are the same as for the regular potion.
         Message: "This is the message the game will give you."
         Hallucinating: "You may also see different messages under certain
         conditions."
  (Reg)  This describes the effect that the standard potion will have (i.e.
         non-cursed and non-blessed).
         Message: "This is the message the game will give you."
         Hallucinating: "You may also see different messages under certain
         conditions."
  (Bls)  This will describe the effects that vapor from a broken potion will
         have on you if the potion was blessed.  If this section is missing,
         the effects are the same as for the regular potion.
         Message: "This is the message the game will give you."
         Hallucinating: "You may also see different messages under certain
         conditions."

Blindness
  (Reg)  Blinds you for 1-5 turns.
         Message:  "It suddenly gets dark."
         Blind or Sleeping:  No message
Booze
  (Reg)  Causes you to be confused for 1-5 turns.
         Message:  "You feel somewhat dizzy"
         Already confused:  No message
Confusion
  (Reg)  Causes you to be confused for 1-5 turns.
         Message:  "You feel somewhat dizzy"
         Already confused:  No message
Extra healing
  (Reg)  Exercises your strength, and if your hit points are less than
         maximum, adds one hit point.
         Message:  None
Gain ability
  (Cur)  No effect.
         Message:  "Ulch!  That potion smells terrible!"
  (Reg)  Increases a random stat by one if that stat is under maximum (i.e.
         as a potion of restore ability would).
         Message:  None
  (Bls)  Increases each stat by one if that stat is under maximum (i.e. as a
         potion of restore ability would).
         Message:  None
Hallucination
  (Reg)  No effect.
         Message: "You have a vision for a moment."
Healing
  (Reg)  Exercises your strength, and if your hit points are less than
         maximum, adds one hit point.
         Message:  None
Invisibility
  (Reg)  No effect.
